  "recap": "The Base Invaders fell just short on Wednesday, August 5, dropping a 15-16 nail-biter to Franki's. It was hardly a quiet night at the plate — the team racked up 21 hits and got 9 players on base, but Franki's matched them run for run in a game that stayed tight from start to finish. Erik led the charge, going 3-for-5 with a home run and 5 RBI, while Brendan was nearly perfect at the plate with a 4-for-4 night and 2 RBI. Julie and Melvin each drove in 2 runs, and Scotty added an RBI of his own, but with a lineup hitting like that, the margin makes this one sting a little more than usual. The offense showed up in a big way — this game just came down to which side could get one more run across, and tonight it wasn't the Base Invaders.",
